                                "sense_id": "c189f564-ef26-3b44-9c67-3b48777cc136",
                                "text": "If a man of senatorian rank should marry a woman of libertine condition, she would not be his wife while he retained his dignity, but she would nevertheless be in a condition to become his wife, if he should lose it."
